<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.69 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.69 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Friday the yield on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) as on June 12 was 10.69 percent.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
